    {
      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_7026d828",
      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: happy_birthday_trump; hasOverallIntent: Harmful; overall-intent-description: The image depicts Donald Trump, a polarizing political figure, with overlaid text that reads 'happy birthday' and 'and believe me, no one can wish you a better happy birthday than me.' The meme uses Trump's recognizable image and his characteristic speaking style to deliver a sarcastic or ironic birthday wish. The intent is to mock or satirize Trump by juxtaposing his persona — often associated with boastful, self-aggrandizing rhetoric — with a birthday greeting. While not explicitly targeting a specific protected group, the meme is harmful because it leverages Trump's controversial public image to create a potentially offensive or divisive message. It may be perceived as mocking his personality or political style, which can be interpreted as disrespectful or inflammatory by some viewers, especially those who hold strong political views about him. The meme's overall intent is to provoke reaction, often through ridicule, and may contribute to a hostile or polarized online environment.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_14778119"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
    },
