      "instance_name": "birthday_wish_scene",
      "label": "Donald Trump delivering a birthday wish",
      "description": "The scene depicts Donald Trump, the central figure, speaking into a microphone while raising his right hand, with overlaid text that reads 'happy birthday' and 'and believe me, no one can wish you a better happy birthday than me.' The scene is composed to convey a sarcastic or ironic birthday greeting using Trump's characteristic speaking style and persona.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
